     class words said the way players say them ("Striker Assault Rifle" is
     also "Striker AR"), and every alias the catalog gives. Each is kept as
     its words and as the run of words from each word on, so a query may
     cross words only from where a word starts: "striker ar" and "mkseven"
     find what they mean, and "scar" does not find "Boss Carti". */
