       Weapons are its two machine guns (D339) */
    [/carbine/i, 'AR'], [/heavy.?weapon/i, 'LMG'],
    /* Siege's own two sides, as its menus shorten them */
    [/attack/i, 'ATK'], [/defend/i, 'DEF'],
    /* Fortnite's other classes and its mode families (D126); "Battle
       Royale" is already BR above */
